{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299990/extras/24aae7650b7e2dc73b4451145f920df4.avif?t=1773011415\" alt=\"Logo for MEMORALYSIS: The Scorched Home\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299990/extras_big/24aae7650b7e2dc73b4451145f920df4.webp?t=1773011415 width=1560 height=337 /></span><i><strong>An unusual case calls for an unusual detective.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEMORALYSIS: The Scorched Home</strong> is a murder mystery visual novel with point-and-click elements about a semi-psychic detective and a girl everyone seems to think is cursed. Follow private detective Philon Delancy to the seaside town of Liselle-sur-Mer and solve the murder of one of its most notable public figures. What starts as a routine house call quickly reveals  a tangle of messy relationships, local superstitions, and past unsolved mysteries. At the center of it all is the victim\u2019s enigmatic niece, Celosia James.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Philon isn't one to balk at whisperings of the occult. How could he, when the greatest tool at his disposal is the ability to catch glimpses of his suspects\u2019 memories? But surely the rumors about the young heiress have been greatly exaggerated. After all, everyone knows demonic possession isn\u2019t real.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Welcome to Liselle-sur-Mer</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299990/extras/8539b26cc788bf287b47b5cf98410e6a.avif?t=1773011415\" alt=\"A background image of a white-tiled balcony overlooking the sea. A woman looks over the railing and a police officer guards a door to the right. The outline of a body is traced in chalk on the floor.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299990/extras_big/8539b26cc788bf287b47b5cf98410e6a.avif?t=1773011415 width=1560 height=430 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate</strong> the mysterious seaside town of Liselle-sur-Mer and unearth its long-buried secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Question</strong> a lively cast of characters to find the truth about the murder of Rhys Beaumont.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Philon's abilities to <strong>dive into suspects' memories</strong> and uncover the things they won't say.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3299990?t=1773011415","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299990/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773011415","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299990/dc4827cd28ad32910d8d23385449b48294f120eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773011415","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299990/dc4827cd28ad32910d8d23385449b48294f120eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773011415","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"MEMORALYSIS deals heavily with themes of abuse and violence. While the portrayal of these things is not excessively graphic, viewer discretion is still advised for those sensitive to these subjects."},"demos":[{"appid":3304210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299990/extras/24aae7650b7e2dc73b4451145f920df4.avif?t=1773011415\" alt=\"Logo for MEMORALYSIS: The Scorched Home\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299990/extras_big/24aae7650b7e2dc73b4451145f920df4.webp?t=1773011415 width=1560 height=337 /></span><i><strong>An unusual case calls for an unusual detective.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEMORALYSIS: The Scorched Home</strong> is a murder mystery visual novel with point-and-click elements about a semi-psychic detective and a girl everyone seems to think is cursed. Follow private detective Philon Delancy to the seaside town of Liselle-sur-Mer and solve the murder of one of its most notable public figures. What starts as a routine house call quickly reveals  a tangle of messy relationships, local superstitions, and past unsolved mysteries. At the center of it all is the victim\u2019s enigmatic niece, Celosia James.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Philon isn't one to balk at whisperings of the occult. How could he, when the greatest tool at his disposal is the ability to catch glimpses of his suspects\u2019 memories? But surely the rumors about the young heiress have been greatly exaggerated. After all, everyone knows demonic possession isn\u2019t real.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Welcome to Liselle-sur-Mer</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299990/extras/8539b26cc788bf287b47b5cf98410e6a.avif?t=1773011415\" alt=\"A background image of a white-tiled balcony overlooking the sea. A woman looks over the railing and a police officer guards a door to the right. The outline of a body is traced in chalk on the floor.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299990/extras_big/8539b26cc788bf287b47b5cf98410e6a.avif?t=1773011415 width=1560 height=430 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate</strong> the mysterious seaside town of Liselle-sur-Mer and unearth its long-buried secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Question</strong> a lively cast of characters to find the truth about the murder of Rhy